@startuml Sequence_ThanhToanVNPay
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title Sequence Diagram - Quy trình Thanh toán VNPay

actor Customer
participant "CheckoutPage" as CP
participant "PaymentService" as PS
participant "VNPay Gateway" as VNP
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> CP: Chọn phương thức VNPay
CP -> PS: createPayment(orderId, amount)
PS -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (status=PENDING)
PS -> VNP: Tạo payment URL (vnp_TxnRef, vnp_Amount, ...)
VNP --> PS: Trả về payment URL
PS --> Customer: Redirect đến VNPay

Customer -> VNP: Nhập thông tin thẻ/OTP
VNP --> Customer: Xác nhận giao dịch

VNP -> PS: Callback IPN (vnp_ResponseCode, signature)
PS -> PS: Verify signature
PS -> DB: UPDATE orders SET payment_status='paid'
DB --> PS: Success
PS --> VNP: Xác nhận đã xử lý IPN
PS --> Customer: Return URL (trang kết quả thanh toán)

@enduml
